Category: transitive-include. net/http.hpp calls isdigit and isspace without including <cctype>
(libstdc++ declares them through <string> and <charconv>), buffer_pool.hpp std::min without
<algorithm> (declared through <memory>), and toml_test.cpp uses std::unordered_map without
including it (declared through <functional>). Adds the includes.

